flowchart LR
  A[Raw ICU records\nIrregular observations] --> B[Trust layer\nPlausibility + credibility]
  B --> C[Temporal features\nExposure outside range\nWorst-so-far\nRecent minus baseline]
  C --> D[Static context\nAge + ICU type]
  D --> E[XGBoost risk\nPlatt calibration]
  E --> F[Sequential evidence\nPersistence + refractory window]
  F --> G[Silent / Watch / Alert\nAudit trail]
  H[Mortality proxy\nNo event timestamp] -. evaluation only .-> E
